# The repo root .gitignore blanket-ignores *.json to keep provider data dumps
# (whoop.json, apple_sleep.json, ...) out of the tree. That silently swallows
# this project's config too, so re-include it here — a deeper .gitignore wins.
# Add any new tracked .json file to this list.
!package.json
!tsconfig.json
!components.json
!static/manifest.json

# The root also ignores the .vscode directory outright. Git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so the directory has to be re-included before any
# file inside it can be — then narrow it back down to the two we want.
!.vscode/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
